From 76c0a8e72f8e7da675b15f86c77167a23cb54c33 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: starlight071986 <113560659+starlight071986@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:03:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] rtnl: log unknown box messages and show them in the web
 UI

Every RTNL log2 group/function pair and log3 type that rtnlEvent() does
not evaluate is appended as TSV to config/rtnl_unknown.log (rotated at
1 MB to .1). Meant for reverse engineering further box data (e.g.
battery level).

- GET  /api/fork/rtnl/log    rotated + current file as text
- POST /api/fork/rtnl/clear  delete both files
- /fork/rtnl-log.html        viewer with summary per group/function,
                             box filter, auto refresh and download
- plugins/rtnlUnknownLog     menu entry under Tonieboxes (iframe)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
